+
+**File**: `src/middleware-rate-limit.ts`
+
+**Features**:
+- Middleware-based rate limiting
+- Configurable limits per endpoint:
+  - Submissions: 50/hour
+  - Uploads: 100/hour
+  - Portal access: 200/hour
+  - AI calls: 30/hour
+  - Default: 1000/hour
+- IP-based tracking
+- Standard rate limit headers
+- 429 Too Many Requests response
